# Optional. Leave unset during `npm run dev` to use the Vite proxy (avoids CORS).
# Proxy target must match backend PORT (default 5050). Override if needed:
# VITE_DEV_API_PROXY=http://localhost:5050
#
# For `vite preview` or production, set your API origin, e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
